00:35:16.065 --> 00:35:19.213
I THINK THAT THE MESSAGE THAT

00:35:19.248 --> 00:35:21.400
BOTH OF YOU CONVEYED TONIGHT

00:35:21.434 --> 00:35:23.640
PROBABLY MORE POWERFUL THAN

00:35:23.641 --> 00:35:25.107
EVERY SHOW I’VE DONE.

00:35:25.141 --> 00:35:27.850
I HOPE THAT SO-CALLED LEADERS

00:35:27.851 --> 00:35:29.203
AND ELECTED OFFICIALS LISTEN.

00:35:29.204 --> 00:35:30.215
BECAUSE EVERY MOMENT DAD HEARS

00:35:30.249 --> 00:35:31.069
YOU.

00:35:31.103 --> 00:35:32.219
I HEAR YOU.

00:35:32.253 --> 00:35:33.479
YOU’RE IN MY PRAYERS.

00:35:33.480 --> 00:35:36.308
IF I CAN EVER DO ANYTHING, I

00:35:36.310 --> 00:35:38.088
WANT TO STAY IN TOUCH WITH YOU.

00:35:38.089 --> 00:35:39.485
AND CONTINUE THIS DISCUSSION OFF

00:35:39.486 --> 00:35:40.004
AIR.

00:35:40.005 --> 00:35:42.365
THANK YOU FOR SHARING YOUR TIME.

00:35:42.400 --> 00:35:44.230
WE PRAY FOR YOU AND YOUR FAMILY.

00:35:44.265 --> 00:35:45.539
SO SAD ABOUT YOUR LOSS.

00:35:45.541 --> 00:35:47.814
THANK YOU SO MUCH BOTH OF YOU

00:35:47.848 --> 00:35:49.235
FOR BEING WITH US FOR ALL THIS

